<title>AUSTRALIA: GOLF-PLAYERS' CHAMPIONSHIP THIRD ROUND SCORES.</title>
<headline>GOLF-PLAYERS' CHAMPIONSHIP THIRD ROUND SCORES.</headline>
<dateline>GOLD COAST, Australia 1996-10-26</dateline>
<text>
<p>Leading third round</p>
<p>scores in the Players' Championship golf tournament at the</p>
<p>par-71 Robina Woods course on Saturday (Australian unless</p>
<p>stated):</p>
<p>201 Bradley Hughes 70 65 66</p>
<p>209 Robert Stephens 74 66 69</p>
<p>210 Scott Laycock 67 71 72, Justin Cooper 67 64 79</p>
<p>212 Peter Lonard 72 73 67, Peter Teravainen (U.S.) 70 74 68,</p>
<p>J.J.West (U.S.) 65 70 77</p>
<p>213 Stephen Leaney 69 72 72, Craig Spence 65 74 74</p>
<p>214 Paul Gow 74 69 71, Anthony Painter 70 69 75</p>
<p>215 Tony Christie (New Zealand) 69 75 71, Gavin Vearing</p>
<p>71 73 71, Wayne Grady 73 70 72, Steve Alker (New Zealand)</p>
<p>71 72 72, Fran Quinn (U.S.) 72 71 72, Gavin Coles 71 72 72,</p>
<p>Jean-Louis Guepy (France) 71 71 73, Michael Long</p>
<p>(New Zealand) 71 71 73, Darren Barnes 72 70 73</p>
